config VIMAR_COMMON_RESTORE_GATE
 bool "Source-only common RESTORE-role loader exception candidate"
 depends on MCUBOOT && SOC_NRF52840 && BOOT_FIRMWARE_LOADER && BOOT_VALIDATE_SLOT0 && FPROTECT
 depends on BOOT_SIGNATURE_TYPE_ECDSA_P256 && BOOT_USE_CC310 && BOOT_USE_NRF_CC310_BL && BOOT_FIH_PROFILE_OFF
 default n
 help
  Opt in only for reviewed common-loader experiments. Requires fresh real
  firmware-loader crypto validation followed by strict selected RESTORE-role
  parsing and committed local backup-anchor identity/UICR checks. Preserves
  full48KiB protection on all ordinary boots and admission errors. It cannot
  be combined with the existing device-bound exact-restorer wrapper module.
  Generic RESTORE code and Android anchor installation are separate work.

config VIMAR_INHERITED_WATCHDOG_HANDOFF
 bool "Wait for an inherited watchdog reset before normal boot"
 depends on VIMAR_COMMON_RESTORE_GATE
 default n
 help
  For first installation from stock firmware with a pause-on-HALT watchdog.
  An early loader hook waits without feeding WDT or entering ordinary boot
  until the real watchdog reset stops it. Inactive WDT adds no delay.
  Android admission requires this capability in the signed descriptor and
  checks the live watchdog profile; this option alone grants no installation.
